OL,3,GNEWSASchool strike called off after
OL,4,A'constructive' talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrike action at a Liverpool Catholic
OL,7,Fschool has been called off after
OL,8,Fcontroversial plans to convert it into
OL,9,Fan academy trust will be revisited by
OL,10,Fthe Archdiocese.
OL,12,FMembers of the National Education Union
OL,13,F(NEU) were set to walk out of St
OL,14,FAnthony of Padua primary school on
OL,15,FWednesday, Thursday and Friday in an
OL,16,Fongoing dispute over plans to move it
OL,17,Finto the St Joseph Catholic
OL,18,FMulti-Academy Trust.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
