OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the union has now said
OL,7,Ffollowing "constructive" negotiations,
OL,8,Fit believed that enough progress had
OL,9,Fbeen made to suspend the action.
OL,11,FThe union and school reached an
OL,12,Fagreement to make representations to
OL,13,Fthe Archdiocese over the plans.
